# chat script: dial a USB-serial LTE modem via the standard AT dial-up
# ("ATD*99#") data mode, common to most Cat-1/Cat-4 LTE modules as a
# PPP fallback alongside any QMI/MBIM/NCM mode they may also support.
#
# EDIT BEFORE USE: "internet" is a placeholder APN -- replace with your
# carrier's real APN before dialing.

ABORT 'BUSY'
ABORT 'NO CARRIER'
ABORT 'NO DIALTONE'
REPORT CONNECT
'' AT
OK ATE0
ABORT 'ERROR'
OK AT+CGDCONT=1,"IP","internet"
OK ATD*99#
CONNECT ''
